# Storyline headline grouping

Do not keep patching stopword lists as the long-term fix.

Headlines (2–3 topic cards, same unfolding story) are packed by title-token overlap: two specific nouns, or a company plus one 5+ letter noun. That is why unrelated Google stories once merged on a shared "they".

When we come back: replace this with a real storyline signal (embeddings, LLM-only groups, or entity+event). Keep the LLM path, but do not trust title-word coincidence.

Frontend: `frontend/lib/story-headlines.ts`
Pipeline: `v3/lib/story_headlines.py`
